  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Dangerous Tail",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Monster Codex pg. 140",
    "definition_raw": "Source Monster Codex pg. 140\nYou have trained your tail into a powerful weapon, and wield it with deadly skill.\n\nPrerequisites: Base attack bonus +5, Lizardfolk.\n\nBenefit: You gain a tail swipe attack. If used as part of a full-attack action, the attack is made at your full base attack bonus – 5. If the tail swipe hits, it deals 1d4 points of damage (assuming you are Medium) + 1/2 your Strength modifier. If you confirm a critical hit against a target with your tail swipe, as a free action you can attempt a trip combat maneuver against that target.",
